       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<p><strong>Producing precise contours on stone slabs is time-consuming because diamond tools have to be dressed regularly. But this is precisely where the potential for process optimization lies. ZOLLER has the right technologies to significantly reduce the time required for perfect results with tool measurement, inspection, and cleaning. </strong></p> <p>Diamond tools are typically re-dressed after 150 to 200 meters of stone processing. This often results in several hours of valuable production time being lost per machine and shift. Knowing the exact condition of your tools reduces this immense time expenditure and ensures greater production capacity. </p> <p>With precision equipment from ZOLLER, you gain comprehensive insights into the condition of your tools with µm precision. You know the values of numerous tool geometries and can accurately capture the contours. With the data obtained, you can optimize process parameters such as the removal rate. This paves the way for perfect edge quality, long tool life, and significantly more machine uptime. Unbeatable competitive advantages. </p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/tr/products/inspection-measuring/stone-cnc-machining\">Show products</a></p>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
      "ftype": "text",
      "id": "c30106",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ]
   ],
   "ftype": "container-2cols",
