    "before": "extra-small",
    "after": "default"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Prepare stone tools for mass production </h2>",
   "body": "<p>All tools, from coarse grinding to fine polishing, are recorded sequentially in a single process, the contours are automatically compared, and deviations are displayed immediately. ZOLLER devices optimize measurement and correction values in relation to each other and can also transfer data automatically and directly to the CNC control system—without the need for re-setup. This ensures that the entire tool set fits together perfectly, significantly reducing both setup time and machine downtime. </p> <p>The finished edges: simply excellent!</p>",
